      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BETTER LIGHT UP (1) finished fifth last time at Gunnedah but could not have been more impressive before that in his sharp 24.87 win at Gunnedah over 431m. Hard to top on the time from two back. SKY KEEPING (3) has a strong record this track and trip with four wins and three placings from nine starts. Hit the frame latest (23.00) when second at this track in a Free For All. Looks suited here and can measure up. LEKTRA BELLA (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (25.60) in a Grade 5 at Gunnedah. The form out of last race has been strong. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. RAY OF EVE (7) placed last time (23.02) at Wagga in a Grade 4/5, finishing second and beaten a neck. Has already won out of this draw.",
